<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-23T01:42:28.178Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:42:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have charged a prosecutor with treason for alleged US involvement in a drug raid, while a Texas man was indicted for a weapons conspiracy linked to the Sinaloa Cartel. A transporter for the Sinaloa Cartel pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana, and another smuggler admitted moving tens of thousands of pounds of drugs in federal court. The AI-powered intel platform that previously tracked El Mencho is now being used to locate the next cartel boss after reports of his death. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPU3cwcFFnU2Z3OURTTzRRcUU5QVdZdERQNENGWHZrWnBmS01PYWpSNlJxXzlXcGk4V3ZHcVV6MXZ6b3FpQkxEM3hINktCMlNrUXB2bDVCejF0Z3ZRWnk0bzd3NEVsbGlUSGZXR3ktZkVJNURDbVVNa0hST1RLS21ocm5aVm40VXdjMUxvWnNNa25NZGl5RUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;SonoraPresente&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxON0FWZHFDZXMtbUlWb0llYkhzRFJKS1NEY3BmMEhael94Z0VISGZmdjBQd0ZUOGxxek1zWFRZUmNaem9TTmp5bl9VOFp0TURJanFLTGN1bXg4OTA1Y1BGNTQxSlJrZ3JILXk4WkNtM3lSNTYyMDVPdExBOHFjR0dhX05pWXRfTWRvaUh1VjVUdXJpMVBCYlBUTkUxZ1NwaFBPZWljZ1FlUGFkcmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Alton Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;KVII&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KWTX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSYX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNV05acDJ3WW5XYTF0WHhMOTZmMkhYcmxlazR0TjNFeHRSRFdxZzNoUlBUY2lCQkJsMENDaEZuR3FBVDBlM2trZDluRFdHN3J1SHFpUk9icU5GbzRPTkY1cHd4emUtbjJ3OEYzeEVaeG9xWkcwRkdDLWMzNjdtQWZzR2hVbEpYSmtjaEVLemNubkJ6b